---
// Lazaret's lockup: the yellow flag and the name in Solitus, in ink on the paper. The blue
// plaque (the 2026-11-05 rebrand) stays on npm and GitHub; here it came out so the flag is
// the one bright thing on the page. The file comes straight from public/brand, which
// apps/site/brand/build.py generates, so the site can't drift from the published art.
import lockup from "../../../public/brand/lazaret-wordmark.svg?raw";
---

<div class="lockup" set:html={lockup} />

<style>
  .lockup {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: min(100%, 320px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .lockup :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
</style>
